{"versions":[{"path":"versions/57a62022-960a-4cc1-87be-4976f38fc019/300bb16b18332731b0a22da5f1d873c5b39592f413053f13af5a3926d4c87339.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"57a62022-960a-4cc1-87be-4976f38fc019","revision":"sha256:300bb16b18332731b0a22da5f1d873c5b39592f413053f13af5a3926d4c87339","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-1\nIn a Red-Black tree, the path from the root to the farthest leaf is no more than twice as long as the path from the root to the nearest leaf."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"fe32bede-82be-4392-aa37-38c61dea9397"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"e7961f8a-0816-483a-ac8b-fd9e9bc545d7"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按红黑树标准定义, 各条根到 NIL 叶的路径黑结点数相同, 相邻红结点之间必有黑结点, 因此最长路径最多为最短路径的两倍"}]}}},{"path":"versions/d47c510c-c48d-48b4-8540-795c63f57bd2/c871babd5598756d65a91d5e0255521a8de13a1f58c6577bb9c3faed329857aa.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"d47c510c-c48d-48b4-8540-795c63f57bd2","revision":"sha256:c871babd5598756d65a91d5e0255521a8de13a1f58c6577bb9c3faed329857aa","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-4\nIn the worst case the DELETE operation in a RED-BLACK tree of n nodes requires Ω(log n) rotations."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"bc1590ed-7f25-48fb-871b-0dc7f00811df"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"f535c356-f377-4c0e-8c4e-300226452ee0"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"标准红黑树删除的重新着色可能沿树上行 O(log n), 旋转次数则有常数上界, Ω(log n) 次旋转的说法错误"}]}}},{"path":"versions/d76d3a2a-6e47-4cc7-a8dc-9ee8aec7d55a/da8517ff24290496f2230e9ca4f6aa19ac19611bb31a69a901b1a2f9aa34c772.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"d76d3a2a-6e47-4cc7-a8dc-9ee8aec7d55a","revision":"sha256:da8517ff24290496f2230e9ca4f6aa19ac19611bb31a69a901b1a2f9aa34c772","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-5\nThe root of a B+ tree of order m has at most m subtrees."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"fb89454d-3f9c-410c-852a-e583b25827da"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"eacf6276-9d8c-4db3-87ac-f1b49fb0e9fa"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"m 阶 B+ 树的内部结点至多有 m 个孩子, 根作为内部结点时同样至多有 m 个子树; 根本身是叶时子树数为 0"}]}}},{"path":"versions/53c1b6cf-be14-4e61-8128-aaed41184876/6e0371d7dba94c190887367dbcecf7cd313c1b3daf55814737bf8e1b57fb39f7.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"53c1b6cf-be14-4e61-8128-aaed41184876","revision":"sha256:6e0371d7dba94c190887367dbcecf7cd313c1b3daf55814737bf8e1b57fb39f7","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-6\nIn a red-black tree with 3 nodes, there must be a red node."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"2b475d3f-a721-4d41-808a-f56cd739ae38"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"cd6db98d-4fc1-409a-a760-bb93c96bdb45"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"反例为黑根具有两个黑色叶孩子, 此树有 3 个结点且符合红黑树条件"}]}}},{"path":"versions/d17b498b-b9e6-43b6-86b0-93b57b0dfe70/3b204c973fba1eb3f0fc2a77db1f71cc767ff4799a1fe69b3bd742c6dcae8fa0.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"d17b498b-b9e6-43b6-86b0-93b57b0dfe70","revision":"sha256:3b204c973fba1eb3f0fc2a77db1f71cc767ff4799a1fe69b3bd742c6dcae8fa0","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-7\nWhen inserting a node into a red-black tree, we shall first insert the node as into an ordinary binary search tree, and then color the node black."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"b5178f7f-f9f8-43ff-9841-f9ea26bb04a7"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"dbd46a6f-58f6-4102-b201-0a6bd24a2fe5"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"标准插入先按二叉搜索树插入, 新结点通常先涂红再修复; 将新结点一开始涂黑可能破坏各路径黑高相等"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7e61ccaf-be51-4dd0-b3b6-fdf304e1b145/77840a8e73bb2f375f98bd812738ed551ac3edb2fd703448dabf57902b073298.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"7e61ccaf-be51-4dd0-b3b6-fdf304e1b145","revision":"sha256:77840a8e73bb2f375f98bd812738ed551ac3edb2fd703448dabf57902b073298","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-8\nIn a B+ tree, leaves and nonleaf nodes have some key values in common."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"f3c2d929-aa15-48e6-aeac-28572b9d3c2d"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"86d95581-ef7b-4756-9580-258fa21a844b"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"在多层 B+ 树的常见实现中, 内部结点的分隔键复制自叶中的数据键, 因而内部结点和叶存在相同键值"}]}}},{"path":"versions/2b626459-5bb3-4edf-8078-aea286dc9ddf/5423ddda1d5843f293f0dc38ad26cabf36c4dc9fc2e2f5f8d6e4eb6691d24ec6.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"2b626459-5bb3-4edf-8078-aea286dc9ddf","revision":"sha256:5423ddda1d5843f293f0dc38ad26cabf36c4dc9fc2e2f5f8d6e4eb6691d24ec6","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-9\nIn a red-black tree with 2 nodes, there must be a red node."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"c5ef5943-24a8-4624-bd1e-bfd0ee8a7fd9"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"cc4cba49-1869-4bcf-affd-5daf8f068468"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"黑根只有一个内部孩子时, 另一侧是 NIL 叶; 为保证两侧黑高相同, 这个内部孩子必须为红色"}]}}},{"path":"versions/6de2f85c-e6cc-40c3-beda-fc504fb69da6/43a810e64b547413c7f09d3da83a3cfbd7262cf69f8dfd0649affb4b7ef5b336.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"6de2f85c-e6cc-40c3-beda-fc504fb69da6","revision":"sha256:43a810e64b547413c7f09d3da83a3cfbd7262cf69f8dfd0649affb4b7ef5b336","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断题 R1-10\nThe time bound of the FIND operation in a B+ tree containing N numbers is O(log N), no matter what the degree of the tree is."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"31642b88-55e9-4fea-b9ee-463fdbf9c913"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"9e8f7e5b-4c84-45ac-9911-2081c1a06e42"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"B+ 树保持平衡, 阶数为 M（M≥3）时树高为 $O(\\log_M N)$; 每层用二分查找需 $O(\\log M)$, 因此总查找时间为 $O(\\log N)$"}]}}},{"path":"versions/ddd3819f-cc75-44f8-8f8b-0758a2d828dc/e5712f897d93ab5b7a56e7e42ff0c58dd87e51c49b99fdc1a73525e1de33219d.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"ddd3819f-cc75-44f8-8f8b-0758a2d828dc","revision":"sha256:e5712f897d93ab5b7a56e7e42ff0c58dd87e51c49b99fdc1a73525e1de33219d","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"单选题 R2-2\nIn an AVL tree of height 4, the maximum difference of the sizes of its left and right subtrees is:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"1","correct":false,"option_id":"ad0b73bf-73d4-4819-8247-3fa3eb88fb49"},{"type":"text","content":"3","correct":false,"option_id":"07ff4b7d-070c-4052-9f46-4176de463f24"},{"type":"text","content":"2","correct":false,"option_id":"60a869bf-8d0a-4541-bb92-c0a177dd28e0"},{"type":"text","content":"5","correct":true,"option_id":"e6903c34-3ada-473d-a9a2-ff41c44c6b7e"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按空树高度为 0、单结点高度为 1 计算, 较高子树高度为 3, 最多 7 个结点; 较矮子树高度为 2, 至少 2 个结点, 差为 5. 若高度按边数定义则数值不同"}]}}},{"path":"versions/c6d12b96-c2c1-4064-808f-68c8e824e69e/0c67115dfac90c78b48a70b54580722eeded157facd6e0993e325ceb4f996c7b.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"c6d12b96-c2c1-4064-808f-68c8e824e69e","revision":"sha256:0c67115dfac90c78b48a70b54580722eeded157facd6e0993e325ceb4f996c7b","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"单选题 R2-3\nWhen doing amortized analysis, which one of the following statements is FALSE?"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"For accounting method, when an operation's amortized cost exceeds its actual cost, we save the difference as credit to pay for later operations whose amortized cost is less than their actual cost","correct":false,"option_id":"cee750ea-3ca0-4b3f-a631-23b20e074539"},{"type":"text","content":"Aggregate analysis shows that for all n, a sequence of n operations takes worst-case time T(n) in total. Then the amortized cost per operation is therefore T(n)/n","correct":false,"option_id":"66a483fb-45f3-4c66-8715-7f2cbb6d411c"},{"type":"text","content":"For potential method, a good potential function should always assume its maximum at the start of the sequence","correct":true,"option_id":"825254aa-05cc-4f36-b6b8-b209949aa423"},{"type":"text","content":"The difference between aggregate analysis and accounting method is that the later one assumes that the amortized costs of the operations may differ from each other","correct":false,"option_id":"7dea0837-4072-43fc-a1ca-ddbfd5071db8"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"势能法通常要求后续势能至少等于初始势能, 以便各步摊还费用之和上界实际费用; 初始势能取最小值即可满足这一条件"}]}}}]}